Third-party data attribution (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(d))
================================================================================

Resecta bundles gazetteer, Bloom-filter, and classifier artifacts produced at
build time by the resecta-datapipeline project from third-party data sources.
The attributions below propagate the upstream notices into this distribution
under Apache License 2.0 Section 4(d), following a conservative-inclusion
practice. The data rows reconcile row-for-row with
resecta-datapipeline/NOTICE.txt; the typeface section at the end is this
product's own (the data pipeline ships no font).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OpenStreetMap (ODbL 1.0) — a provenance acknowledgement
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This product includes no data derived from OpenStreetMap. The street-type list
in address_components.json is a fixed list, and the street-suffix staging file
in resecta-datapipeline that cites OpenStreetMap as a source is not read by any
build. The row is kept as a provenance acknowledgement. OpenStreetMap data is
(c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License
(ODbL) 1.0; see https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
OpenAddresses — a provenance acknowledgement
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This product includes no data derived from OpenAddresses
(https://openaddresses.io/); the street-suffix staging file in
resecta-datapipeline that cites it is not read by any build. The row is kept as
a provenance acknowledgement. OpenAddresses' source catalogue is CC0 1.0; its
address data carries each original source's licence.

================================================================================
ParaNames (CC BY 4.0)
================================================================================

The person-name Bloom filters bundled in this product (given-names.bloom,
surnames.bloom) are membership-derived from several inputs, ParaNames among
them, with public-domain and CC0 name lists (Census, SSA and popular-names
data). ParaNames, by Jonne Sälevä and Constantine Lignos
(https://github.com/bltlab/paranames, release v2024.05.07.0), is licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes made: PER-type entries
were filtered and their names hashed into Bloom filters; no names are
reproduced. The bltlab/paranames code is MIT-licensed, Copyright (c) 2022 Jonne
Sälevä and Constantine Lignos.

